RE: Translation.
You're missing dotside on your cmevla (whether or not you care is
another issue entirely), your grouping is confusing (article 2
"madzeienai" needs denpa bu, article 3 "tadjilo" and article 13
"siskutu'a" you need to either use whitespace or mark emphasis because
this breaks apart to {ta djIlo} not {tAdji lo} and {siskUtu'a} not
{sIsku tu'a}) and you have a few invalid words (line 4 "lo
nunmadxagtik" is not valid), and you have some unnecessary usage of
{cu} (on line 8 "la biblos. cu selsku", which actually doesn't make
sense, btw). (While we're on the topic, you should never have to use
CU, so if it looks like you need it, then you need to not use it and
study more instead.)

